{"id":"u-cea77b29-b3e5-4c8c-a667-89c523440c85","src":"community","title":"AyıAdam","author":"furkan B.","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/pCWyOJ-ayiadam","desc":"Classic StrongLifts 5×5 with added upper-body accessories (mid delts, rear delts, upper chest, and lats), spread across 6 days.\n\nOn the first day, choose a weight you can lift easily for 10 reps.\nIncrease the weight by 2.5 kg (5 kg for deadlifts) the next session.\n\nDo not increase the weight if you cannot complete 5×5 with a maximum RPE of 9.0.\n\nIf you fail to complete 5×5 at ≤9.0 RPE for 2–3 consecutive sessions, deload the weight by 10%.\n\nIf you cannot progress for 2–3 weeks, switch to 3×5 and repeat the same process.\nAfter stalling again, switch to 3×3 and follow the same progression rules.\nAfter stalling again, switch to (1×3) or (2×3) -5% and follow the same progression rules.","level":["Beginner","Intermediate"],"goals":["Muscle","Strength"],"equipment":["Garage Gym"],"minutes":60,"joins":0,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-03-15T03:27:11.731Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Day 1","Day 2","Day 3","Day 4","Day 5","Day 6"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"x":5}]},{"n":"Lateral Raise (Cable)","sets":[{"r":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Incline Bench Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":8,"x":3}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"x":5}]},{"n":"Deadlift (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5}]},{"n":"Lat Pulldown","sets":[{"r":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Face Pull","sets":[{"r":25,"x":3}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Overhead Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"x":5}]},{"n":"Incline Bench Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Lateral Raise (Cable)","sets":[{"r":8,"x":3}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"x":5}]},{"n":"Bent Over Row (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"x":5}]},{"n":"Face Pull","sets":[{"r":25,"x":3}]},{"n":"Straight Arm Pulldown","sets":[{"r":10,"x":3}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"x":5}]},{"n":"Lateral Raise (Cable)","sets":[{"r":8,"